            },
            "reviewBody": "I’d agree the recipe is not as tender as some muffin recipes and a bit more scone-like - but I also liked it. I’d also up the lemon verbena, although maybe I misunderstood - is it 1/3 cup chopped lemon verbena or 1/3 cup lemon verbena chopped? I feel Iike something between the two will",
