              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kelly Keson Miller"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I also grow lemon verbena in my garden and wanted somethg to try it out on. A lovely recipe, but you really can't taste the lemon verbena. Maybe I will add more next time? The batter is scone like but I pored mine into oiled mini loaf pans and they turned out perfect, they do have a slight green color to them which is a novelty and they will be perfect with my tea tonight, :)",
